    "sections": {
        "description": "The Electrical Repair theme is a modern, responsive, and professional solution tailored for electricians and electrical service providers in this beautiful city. It supports a variety of services including electrical repair, installation, maintenance, and emergency support while ensuring a visually appealing and user-friendly experience across all devices. With sections dedicated to service highlights, team profiles, and interactive galleries, it effectively engages clients. The theme also includes features like Call to Action (CTA) buttons and testimonials to showcase your expertise. Built with clean, optimized code, it allows for easy customization to match your brand identity. Plus, it integrates seamlessly with WooCommerce for service bookings and payments, Contact Form 7 for lead captures, and WPML for multilingual support, making it an excellent choice for any electrical services business looking to thrive online in the vibrant cityscape."
    },
